  <document-link format="APPLICATION/PDF" url="https://www.ms.dk/sites/default/files/publikationer/publications/2023/AA%20Bangladesh%20SPA%20Case%20study%202023.pdf">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">ActionAid Bangladesh SPA II case study 2023</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people from the youth organisation Cyber Teens Foundation, previously known as the
Narail Volunteers,actively advocated to counter the increase in cyber-bullying and online
gender-based violence (GBV) in Bangladesh.In 2023 this culminated with the establishment
of the Government-led National Committee on the prevention of cybercrimes as well as a 24/7
Helpline for adolescents navigating cyberspace.</narrative>
   </description>
